From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zenderal <noreply@zenderal.local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 15:13:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ui(zenderal): Futura Book BT and an Enderal prologue
 warning

The font stack starts with 'futura-book', declared in index.html and supplied at
packaging time (commercial font, not committed); without it the UI falls back to
futura-condensed-medium. The connect dialog warns about Enderal's prologue
instead of Helgen; the other languages fall back to the English line.
